:"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6305,"speakerName":"アカトル","textMapHash":3972392698,"text":"だが、ヴァレサが嘘をつくような子じゃないのはみんな知ってる。それに緑のキノコ自体、オレたちも謎に思ってた。","nextNodeIds":[150310113]},{"nodeId":150310113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6305,"speakerName":"アカトル","textMapHash":1615835170,"text":"悪い兆しが見つかった以上、調査を手伝うぜ！","nextNodeIds":[150310114]},{"nodeId":150310114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1091,"speakerName":"イアンサ","textMapHash":4031717762,"text":"何か力になれることがあったら、遠慮なく言ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[150310115]},{"nodeId":150310115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1656483714,"text":"こんなあっさり受け入れてもらえるなんて！？","nextNodeIds":[150310116]},{"nodeId":150310116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3428555730,"text":"ありがとう、みんな。","nextNodeIds":[150310117]},{"nodeId":150310117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6393,"speakerName":"アトリー","textMapHash":451164938,"text":"さっき高温でキノコを調理する必要があるって言ってたな。ちょっと待っててくれ、さっそく用意しよう。","nextNodeIds":[150310118]},{"nodeId":150310118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6393,"speakerName":"アトリー","textMapHash":1163541722,"text":"——待たせたな！鉄板で焼いてみたぞ、この温度なら十分だろ。","nextNodeIds":[150310119]},{"nodeId":150310119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4167762386,"text":"わぁ、やっぱりすごくいい匂いだな。オイラの食欲も完全復活だぞ。","nextNodeIds":[150310120]},{"nodeId":150310120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":4011700634,"text":"じ、じゃあ…いただきます！","nextNodeIds":[150310121]},{"nodeId":150310121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15140,"speakerName":"ビフロンス","textMapHash":3502004514,"text":"ほほう…","nextNodeIds":[150310122]},{"nodeId":150310122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3980410226,"text":"聞こえたか？あいつの声だ！","nextNodeIds":[150310123]},{"nodeId":150310123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15140,"speakerName":"ビフロンス","textMapHash":4092885314,"text":"ハーッハッハッハ、少しは分かってきたようだな。だが、この程度の温度で誠意は示せぬぞ？","nextNodeIds":[150310124]},{"nodeId":150310124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15140,"speakerName":"ビフロンス","textMapHash":2854906850,"text":"そこらの家で出せる火力と、どこにでもある道具でササッと作っただけではないか。それでこの「キノコの賢主」に認めてもらえると？","nextNodeIds":[150310125]},{"nodeId":150310125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15140,"speakerName":"ビフロンス","textMapHash":79439794,"text":"人間というのは実に情けない。手がかりを与えてやれば難問も解けるが…","nextNodeIds":[150310126]},{"nodeId":150310126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15140,"speakerName":"ビフロンス","textMapHash":1340616162,"text":"それがなくなった途端、何もできない。こんな方法で上手くいくと思ったか？まさに愚の骨頂なり！","nextNodeIds":[150310127]},{"nodeId":150310127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15140,"speakerName":"ビフロンス","textMapHash":1450266826,"text":"もっと工夫することだ、フハハハハッ…！","nextNodeIds":[150310128]},{"nodeId":150310128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6393,"speakerName":"アトリー","textMapHash":3949169682,"text":"ど、どうだ？声は聞こえたか？","nextNodeIds":[150310129]},{"nodeId":150310129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1114181154,"text":"うわ…やっぱりヤなやつだったな！","nextNodeIds":[150310130]},{"nodeId":150310130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3484331682,"text":"温度が足りないんだってよ。面倒くさいなぁ、もう！","nextNodeIds":[150310131,150310132]},{"nodeId":150310131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1563530722,"text":"でも何を企んでるのかを知るためには…","nextNodeIds":[150310133]},{"nodeId":150310133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6305,"speakerName":"アカトル","textMapHash":616903674,"text":"火力を上げるとなると、もっと別の方法を探す必要があるな。","nextNodeIds":[150310134]},{"nodeId":150310134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6305,"speakerName":"アカトル","textMapHash":2974755842,"text":"みんな聞いたか！なんでもいいから、とにかく熱いもんを持ってきてくれ！","nextNodeIds":[150310135]},{"nodeId":150310135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6393,"speakerName":"アトリー","textMapHash":2072838146,"text":"ああ、何とかできないか考えてみよう！","nextNodeIds":[150310136]},{"nodeId":150310136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1091,"speakerName":"イアンサ","textMapHash":3194912562,"text":"任せてくれ！","nextNodeIds":[150310137]},{"nodeId":150310137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":3220960498,"text":"わたしたちも探しに行こっか？","nextNodeIds":[150310138]},{"nodeId":150310138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1185314602,"text":"そうだな！でもオイラたち、まだこの辺りのことをあまり知らないから…ヴァレサはなにかいいアイデアないか？","nextNodeIds":[150310139]},{"nodeId":150310139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":299426082,"text":"う～ん…具体的には思いつかないけど、火山の近くを探してみるのはどうかなぁ？","nextNodeIds":[150310140]},{"nodeId":150310140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":175048570,"text":"火山はいつもいろんなものを噴き出してるから、何かいいものが混じってるかも。","nextNodeIds":[150310141]},{"nodeId":150310141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":228809538,"text":"よし、じゃあ行ってみようぜ！熱々の素材を見つけて、絶対にあの性悪キノコの顔面に投げつけてやるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":150310132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3292929050,"text":"付き合ってあげるしかない。","nextNodeIds":[150310133]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1503101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_10465:-2693.247,283.985,10212.020,0.000,299.209,0.000]"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":1503102,"order":3,"stepDescription":"必要な高温の材料を探す","stepDescTextMapHash":872023220,"finishCon