{"nodeId":150310209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":2260514114,"text":"そだね…わたし、争いごとって好きじゃないし、勝ち負けをあんまり気にしないタイプだから。毎日楽しく過ごせるだけで十分なんだぁ～","nextNodeIds":[150310210]},{"nodeId":150310210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":3527201738,"text":"そんなわたしに、イアンサコーチはいろんなことを教えてくれたの。「力は目的じゃなく手段だ」とか…","nextNodeIds":[150310211]},{"nodeId":150310211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":3705031098,"text":"アビスが攻めてきたとき、もし普段から鍛えてなかったら、元素力をコントロールできるようになってなかったら、ただ魔物が暴れるのを見てることしかできなかったと思う。","nextNodeIds":[150310212]},{"nodeId":150310212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":2403150866,"text":"どんなに怖くても、勇気を出してみんなを守らなきゃって思ったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[150310213,150310214]},{"nodeId":150310213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1553622074,"text":"そうだね。","nextNodeIds":[150310215]},{"nodeId":150310215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":1478477450,"text":"ありがとう。どんどん勇敢になって、わたしフィエテナさまみたいになるんだ！","nextNodeIds":[150310216]},{"nodeId":150310216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1098,"speakerName":"ヴァレサ","textMapHash":3170145338,"text":"行こっか、歩きながら探そ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":150310214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3132733042,"text":"ヴァレサって強いんだね。","nextNodeIds":[150310215]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1503102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_10476:-29